/**
    VoicelinesWarrior

    Author: Valdemar
    Version:

    Description:
    Warrior AI bark, companion chat, and companion reply voiceline
    keys/text used by AI profile libraries.

    Credits:
    - AI/AI_Voicelines.j
    - AI/Classes/AI_Warrior.j

    How to install:
    Import after `Voicelines.j`. Consumers require this library directly.

    API:
    Global `VL_WARRIOR_*` constants.

**/
library VoicelinesWarrior requires Voicelines

